  "question": {
    "text": "If $f: R \\rightarrow R, g: R \\rightarrow \\mathrm{R}$ are defined by $f(x)=5 x-$ $3, g(x)=x^2+3$, then $g o f^{-1}(3)$ is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
